fa>نز</tajweed>َلَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ لَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ر</tajweed>ِّزْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>قٍ ف</tajweed>َجَعَلْت<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْهُ حَرَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مًا و</tajweed>َحَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ل<tajweed class=ikhafa>اً ق</tajweed>ُلْ ءَآللَّهُ أَذِنَ لَكُمْ‌ۖ أَمْ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ تَفْتَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٩</span>","End":"٥٩","PageNumber":215,"JuzNumber":11,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":177,"MaqraNumber":86,"HizbNumber":22,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":10,"SurahIndex":"010","VerseNumber":60,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا ظَنُّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَفۡتَرُونَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ٱلۡكَذِبَ يَوۡمَ ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَذُو فَضۡلٍ عَلَى ٱلنَّاسِ وَلَٰكِنَّ أَكۡثَرَهُمۡ لَا يَشۡكُرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَمَا ظَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ يَفْتَرُونَ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَذِبَ يَوْمَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقِيَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مَةِ‌ۗ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ لَذُو فَضْلٍ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسِ وَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَشْكُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٠</span>","End":"٦٠","PageNumber":215,"JuzNumber":11,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":177,"MaqraNumber":86,"HizbNumber":22,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":10,"SurahIndex":"010","VerseNumber":61,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا تَكُونُ فِي شَأۡنٖ وَمَا تَتۡلُواْ مِنۡهُ مِن قُرۡءَانٖ وَلَا تَعۡمَلُون